  "prefLabel": "Puc 1804.03 Appeals Process",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1804.03 Appeals Process.\n\n(a) Any applicant whose application has been initially disapproved by the commission may request an informal reconsideration conference with the director of the sustainable energy division at the commission.\n\n(b) The director of the sustainable energy division at the commission, or his or her designee, shall hold an informal conference requested pursuant to (a) above, within 10 working days of the request for a conference.\n\n(c) Within 10 working days of the informal conference referred to in (a) above, the director of the sustainable energy division shall, pursuant to RSA 541-A:29, II(a):\n\n(1) Issue a written decision which shall:\n\na. Affirm, reverse or modify the decision on the application; and\n\nb. Summarize the results of the informal conference and the basis for the decision; and\n\n(2) Provide a copy of the written decision, referred to in (c)(1) above, to the applicant.\n\n(d) Any applicant dissatisfied with the decision of the director of the sustainable energy division may request in writing, within 10 working days of receipt of the written decision, a formal hearing before the commission, pursuant to Puc 203, to review the decision.\n\nSource. #6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07\n\nNew. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07\n\nNew. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15\n\nNew. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1800.html"
